  "design_rationale": "Paired development follow-up to cradle DOE v2. DOE v2 showed that [0, +2, -2] mm was the only candidate above the fixed 0.50 lift-contact gate but missed the fixed 80 mm lift gate by 0.85 mm. The PI0.5 dataset labels the lift residual as stage-constant, while the expert executor previously multiplied it by lift progress. This follow-up first corrects that contract mismatch, then tests only 0, 2, and 3 mm common lift-height compensation plus the DOE-v2 +2 mm Y center candidate.",
